1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,543
And Y-G's version of the pyramid is steeper than most.

2
00:00:03,543 --> 00:00:10,863
The company debuted exactly two girl groups in the fourteen years between 2NE1 and BABYMONSTER.

3
00:00:10,863 --> 00:00:14,097
That is the entire point — and the entire risk.

4
00:00:14,097 --> 00:00:17,087
When you launch that rarely, you cannot launch small.

5
00:00:17,087 --> 00:00:20,476
Every debut is a bet of the label's whole reputation.

6
00:00:20,476 --> 00:00:26,765
Which is why, in 2023, everything about this project was engineered to be oversized.

